### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Contact form delivery
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### The contact form posts to Formspree when a form id is present.
### Create a free form at https://formspree.io/f/<your-id> and paste the id below.
### If this is empty (or left as-is), the form falls back to opening the user's
### mail client with the message pre-filled — it never silently fails.
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=

### Where the mailto fallback sends the message. Defaults to 0xjave@gmail.com.
VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=0xjave@gmail.com

### Public site origin, used for canonical + OG tags at runtime (optional).
### e.g. https://your-domain.com
VITE_SITE_URL=
